<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">

        <div class="govuk-panel govuk-panel--confirmation">
            <h1 class="govuk-panel__title">
                Network manager invited
            </h1>
        </div>

        <p class="govuk-body">We have emailed them to let them know they have been invited to be a network manager for your organisation. </p>
        <p class="govuk-body"><strong>What happens next:</strong></p>
        <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
            <li>if they accept, you'll confirm their access</li>
            <li>if they decline, you'll be notified</li>
            <li>once confirmed, they can add heat networks for your organisation</li>
        </ul>

        <a href="@Url.Action("ManageLeads", "NetworkLeads")" role="button" draggable="false" class="govuk-button" data-module="govuk-button">
            Invite a network manager
        </a>

    </div>
</div>